<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="nl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Gezelle & Wikidata | Jenske Verhamme</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #ffffff;
            --accent-color: #AADDDD;
            --text-color: #000000;
            --grid-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }

        body { 
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; 
            background-color: var(--bg-color); 
            color: var(--text-color); 
            margin: 0; 
            padding: 0; 
            line-height: 1.5;
            background-image: 
                linear-gradient(var(--grid-color) 1px, transparent 1px),
                linear-gradient(90deg, var(--grid-color) 1px, transparent 1px);
            background-size: 30px 30px;
        }

        nav {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-bottom: 5px solid #000;
            padding: 20px 40px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .nav-link {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #000;
            font-weight: 900;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        }

        header {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 60px auto 40px auto;
            padding: 0 40px;
        }

        .project-meta {
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #666;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        h1 { 
            font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 5.5rem); 
            font-weight: 900; 
            line-height: 0.85; 
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: -3px;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .hero-layout {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
            gap: 40px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .intro-text {
            background: #000;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 40px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            box-shadow: 15px 15px 0px var(--accent-color);
        }

        /* Netwerk Visualisatie Style Blocks */
        .node-container {
            position: relative;
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 100px auto;
            padding: 0 40px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .node-card {
            border: 3px solid #000;
            padding: 30px;
            background: #fff;
            position: relative;
            transition: 0.3s;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: inherit;
        }

        .node-card:hover {
            background: var(--accent-color);
            transform: scale(1.02);
        }

        .node-card h3 {
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-top: 0;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .node-card::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            background: #000;
            border-radius: 50%;
            top: -10px;
            left: -10px;
        }

        /* Specifieke deeltjes */
        .viz-box {
            grid-column: span 2;
            background: #f0f0f0;
            border: 2px dashed #000;
            padding: 50px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .viz-placeholder {
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #888;
        }

        .btn-link {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 20px;
            background: #000;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }

        .node-card:hover .btn-link {
            background: #fff;
            color: #000;
        }

        .github-link-box {
            background: var(--accent-color);
            padding: 60px;
            text-align: center;
            border-top: 5px solid #000;
            margin-top: 100px;
        }

        footer { 
            padding: 40px; 
            text-align: center; 
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero-layout, .node-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .viz-box { grid-column: 1; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav>
        <a href="../../index.html" class="nav-link">The Person</a>
        <a href="../index.html" class="nav-link">Data & ICT</a>
        <a href="../../index.html#contact" class="nav-link">The Signal</a>
    </nav>

    <header>
        <div class="project-meta">PROJECT: GEZELLE_LOD // PARTNER: MEEMOO</div>
        <h1>Guido Gezelle &<br>Linked Data</h1>
        
        <div class="hero-layout">
            <div class="intro-text">
                Hoe maak je de onzichtbare netwerken van een 19e-eeuwse dichter zichtbaar met moderne webtechnologie? 
                Door archiefdata te mappen naar Wikidata en te ontsluiten via SPARQL, transformeren we statische informatie naar dynamische kennisnetwerken.
            </div>
            <div style="border: 4px solid #000; padding: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: var(--accent-color);">
                <span style="font-weight: 900; font-size: 1.5rem; text-align: center; text-transform: uppercase; transform: rotate(-5deg);">Data is de<br>nieuwe poëzie</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="node-container">
        
        <div class="viz-box">
            <h2 style="text-transform: uppercase;">Interactieve Netwerken</h2>
            <p>De kern van het project: netwerkvisualisaties van Gezelle's correspondenten en thema's.</p>
            <div class="viz-placeholder">
                [ IMAGE / IFRAME: GEZELLE_NETWERK_VIZ ]
            </div>
        </div>

        <a href="https://guacamolekoala.github.io/DocumentationVisualisationsGuidoGezelle/" target="_blank" class="node-card">
            <span class="step-num">DOCS_01</span>
            <h3>Projectwebsite</h3>
            <p>De volledige documentatiehub waar alle stappen van het project worden uitgelegd voor erfgoedprofessionals.</p>
            <span class="btn-link">Visit Docs →</span>
        </a>

        <div class="node-card">
            <span class="step-num">DOCS_02</span>
            <h3>Handleidingen</h3>
            <p>Stapsgewijze gidsen over het mappen van metadata, het gebruik van OpenRefine en het bevragen van de Wikidata Query Service (SPARQL).</p>
        </div>

        <div class="node-card">
            <span class="step-num">PUB_01</span>
            <h3>Artikel Kennisbank</h3>
            <p>Een reflectie op het project, gepubliceerd in de meemoo kennisbank, over de waarde van Linked Open Data voor kleinere archieven.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="node-card">
            <span class="step-num">TECH_01</span>
            <h3>Queries & Data</h3>
            <p>Directe links naar de SPARQL-queries die de basis vormen voor de visualisaties. Raw data meets research.</p>
        </div>

    </main>

    <section class="github-link-box">
        <h2 style="text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 2.5rem; margin: 0;">Code & Repositories</h2>
        <p>Alle broncode van de visualisaties en documentatie is open source beschikbaar.</p>
        <a href="https://github.com/guacamolekoala/DocumentationVisualisationsGuidoGezelle" class="btn-link" style="font-size: 1.2rem; padding: 15px 40px;">View on GitHub</a>
    </section>

    <footer>
        JENSKE VERHAMME // GEZELLE_CASE_STUDY // 2026
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
